  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Armenia Refugee Crisis - Resilience for All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening national capacities for enhanced resilience and greater opportunities for refugees and host communities to overcome current and emerging challenges in Armenia. 
Part of UN Refugee REsponse Plan RRP. UNDP Strategic Objectives:

&#x2022;	Emergency response and stabilization (Months 1-12)
&#x2022;	Sustaining core government functions and services (Months 1-36)
&#x2022;	Inclusive, equitable and green economic growth (Months 3-36)
&#x2022;	Social cohesion (Months 6-36)

Activities include restoring livelihoods, jobs, entrepreneurship, and businesses, with a focus on youth and women, and advancing the agency of youth, women and people living with disabilities through inclusive processes and empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
